Column	Label 			Description and Units
1	tx_height		TX height above ground m
2	tx_roll			TX roll degrees, left wing up is +ve
3	tx_pitch		TX pitch degrees, nose down is +ve
4	tx_yaw			TX yaw degrees degrees, turn left is +ve
5	txrx_dx			TX-RX inline separation m, RX in front of TX +ve
6	txrx_dy			TX-RX transverse separation m, RX left of TX +ve
7	txrx_dz			TX-RX vertical separation m, RX above TX is +ve
8	rx_roll			RX roll degrees degrees, left wing up is +ve
9	rx_pitch		RX pitch degrees degrees, nose down is +ve
10	rx_yaw			RX yaw degrees degrees, turn left is +ve
11	N			number of layers
11+1	cond:1			layer 1 conductivity S/m
11+2	cond:2			layer 2 conductivity S/m
...
11+N	cond:N			layer N conductivity S/m
11+N+1  thickness:1		layer 1 thickness m
11+N+2	thickness:2		layer 2 thickness m
...
11+2N-1	thickness:N-1		layer N-1 thickness m
11+2N	chargeability:1		layer 1 chargeability (optional)
11+2N+1	chargeability:2		layer 2 chargeability
...
11+3N-1	chargeability:N		layer N chargeability
11+3N	frequencydependence:1	layer 1 frequency-dependence  (optional)
11+3N+1	frequencydependence:2	layer 2 frequency-dependence
...
11+4N-1	frequencydependence:N	layer N frequency-dependence
11+4N	timeconstant:1		layer 1 time constant sec  (optional)
11+4N+1	timeconstant:2		layer 2 time constant sec
...
11+5N-1	chargeability:N		layer N time constant sec
